<title>KAZAKHSTAN: TABLE-Kazakh 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 14.96 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kazakh 6-mth T-bill yield rises to 14.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on an issue of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills rose to 14.96 at an auction on July 21 from 14.80 at the last auction on July 7, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the auction:</p>
<p>					   July 21	    July 7</p>
<p> Series number			 KZ46K2201981     KZ46K0801980</p>
<p> Issue volume (million tenge)	  600		  600</p>
<p> Bids (nominal, million tenge)	 1,677		1,974</p>
<p> Sold (nominal, million tenge)	 600		  606</p>
<p> Average price			 93.04 pct	  93.11</p>
<p> Average yield			 14.96		14.80</p>
<p> Tenor				   182 days	   182 days</p>
<p> Maturity				Jan 22, 1998     Jan 8, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
